# onyx-pipeline

Deterministic, manifest-first document ingestion & indexing pipeline (safe mode extraction).

## Features (initial skeleton)
- Manifest builder (streaming library scan) with frozen schema.
- PDF harvest (raster placeholder) and text extraction (PyMuPDF) stubs.
- OCR gate + engine stubs (local only).
- Chunking with deterministic policies.
- Metas / BM25 / Embeddings (deterministic pseudo-embeddings 8192-d).
- Validation & summary reporting.

## Quick Start (PowerShell)
```powershell
python -m venv .venv; .\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -e .

# Build manifest
onyx-manifest build --lib .\tests\fixtures --out .\out

# Run full safe pipeline
onyx-pipeline run --lib .\tests\fixtures --out .\out --ocr-lang eng

# Validate outputs
onyx-validate --out .\out
```

## Layout
```
src/onyx_pipeline/
  manifest/  # manifest builder & schema
  harvest/   # pdf raster + ocr stubs
  text/      # text extraction & normalization
  chunking/  # chunk rules & writer
  metas/     # meta summaries
  search/    # bm25 + embeddings
  reporting/ # structured logging + summary
  storage/   # paths + atomic writes + safety
  validate/  # validator
  cli/       # argparse entrypoint
```

